---
import { Aside } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<div class="pp-api-key-callout">
  <Aside type="note" title="Sandbox vs live keys">
    Every API key is named after the environment it belongs to:
    <code>pp_sandbox_…</code> hits the free sandbox environment (renders are watermarked and never billed).
    <code>pp_live_…</code> hits production (billed). Keys of any other environment follow
    <code>pp_&lt;env&gt;_…</code>, for example <code>pp_staging_…</code>.
    All keys target the same endpoint.
  </Aside>
</div>
